 County","/arc-plc/north-carolina/iredell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids shows October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. On that same middle, October to November ran 50% of normal in 2025 and November to December ran 38% in 2025. So far in 2026, the middle shows March to April at 39% and June to July at 108%.</p>"}
